  NodeID: VillageElderCat
  SpeakerName: Village Elder
  DialogueText: '"Ah, I see. Your cat seems to wander about town, but there is the
    possibility that it may have wandered to the dragon''s lair, so if you don''t
    find it in town, check there. Though it appears that the dragon may be attacking
    the town out of loneliness, so be careful, the dragon may snatch you up as a
    companion."'
